# Changelog

> All notable changes to the Kay's Wellness Centre engine. Follows
> [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) conventions. Chronological, newest last.

---

## [Unreleased] — Sprint 45 — Accessibility Hardening & Session Architecture Refactor

### Added

- **Accessibility fixes for `/admin/login` page (Lighthouse a11y 88 → 100).** Footer heading hierarchy: added `sr-only` `<h2>Footer</h2>` section root, changed `h4` → `h3` for "Explore", "Legal", "Specialties", "Reach Us". Social icon links: added `aria-label` per platform (Instagram/Facebook/X) and `aria-hidden="true"` on icons. Contact form select: removed explicit `id` from `<select>` so `FormControl` (via Radix `Slot`) forwards generated `formItemId`, allowing `FormLabel htmlFor={formItemId}` to correctly associate. (`Footer.tsx`, `ReachUs.tsx`.)

### Changed

- **Session architecture refactor** — split `session.server.ts` into two modules to resolve TanStack Start import-protection error (`@tanstack/react-start/server` denied in client environment):
  - `session.server.ts` — Pure crypto utilities (`signToken`, `verifyToken`, `hashPassword`, `verifyPassword`). Safe for client bundle.
  - `session-cookie.server.ts` — Server-only cookie reading (`getCookie`), session validation (`getSession`, `getCurrentOrgId`, `getCurrentUserId`, `getCurrentUserRole`), revocation checks (`isSessionActive`, `requireActiveRole`). Only imported by server functions.
  - `session.server.ts` re-exports cookie functions for backward compatibility with existing tests.
  - **18 files migrated** to import from correct module: `tenant.server.ts`, `permissions.server.ts`, `auth.server.ts`, `diagnostics.server.ts`, `billing.server.ts`, `leads.server.ts`, `contact.server.ts`, `mpesa.server.ts`, `registration.server.ts`, `checkout.server.ts`, `reconciliation.server.ts`, `trials.server.ts`, `telemetry.server.ts`, `marketing/leads.server.ts`, `marketing/automation.server.ts`, `marketing/reviews.server.ts`, `auth-check.server.ts`, `webhooks.server.ts`, `exports.server.ts`.

### Tests

- Full suite: **762 passing across 75 files**, `tsc --noEmit` exit 0, ESLint 0 errors, production build OK.
- All regression tests pass: `tenant-isolation-p0.test.ts` (22), `require-org-revocation.test.ts` (3), `contact-message.test.ts` (13), `alerts.test.ts` (5).

