## [Unreleased] — Sprint 44 — 80/20 Execution Hardening (RBAC + Demo Data + PII + M-Pesa CSV)

### Added

- **Server-side RBAC on all critical mutation paths (80/20: 8 functions).** `requireRole(CLINIC_OWNER)` now enforced on `submitLead`, `updateLead`, `deleteLead`, `bookSlot`, `cancelSlot`, `reserveSlot`, `scheduleAppointment`, `dispatchLeadMessage`. Staff can read (triage desk) but cannot mutate owner data. (`leads.server.ts`, `scheduling.server.ts`, `resources.server.ts`, `dispatch.server.ts`; `rbac-completeness.test.ts` updated.)
- **Demo seed data for Dr. Jackie walkthrough.** `npm run db:seed-demo` creates 15 leads across pipeline stages, 5 invoices (2 paid via STK), 3 messages, 2 reviews, automation state. Every screen tells a story. (`seed-demo.server.ts`, `db-seed-demo.ts`.)
- **Owner→Staff invite flow.** `/admin/settings/operations` "Invite Staff" modal → `inviteStaff` server fn creates `staff` user with temp password; role enforced on server. (`auth.server.ts`, `operations.tsx`.)
- **M-Pesa CSV staging reconciliation test.** Real Safaricom Daraja CSV format parsed and reconciled against issued invoices; idempotent replay verified. (`mpesa-csv-staging.test.ts`.)
- **PII encryption on message ledger.** `from_address`/`to_address` encrypted at rest; decrypted on read. (`messaging.server.ts`; `messaging.test.ts` mocks updated.)
- **Reconciliation idempotency on CSV path.** Duplicate CSV rows return existing reconciliation (no double-charge). (`reconciliation.server.ts`, `reconciliation.test.ts` updated.)

### Changed

- **All reconciliation tests updated** for idempotency check mock (762 tests green).
- **RBAC completeness test flipped** from "allows staff" to "forbidden for staff" — documents gap closure.

