## [Unreleased] — Sprint 42 — Tier 5 Execution Hardening (Honest Delivery + App-Wide Revocation)

### Added

- **App-wide session revocation (the real boundary).** `requireOrg()` is now async and re-verifies
  the `user_sessions` row (`isSessionActive`, fail closed) on **every** tenant-scoped server call;
  `requireRole()` is async and awaits it. All ~48 call sites across 18 files now `await
  requireOrg()` / `await requireRole()`. A logged-out / revoked session is rejected everywhere —
  not just at the diagnostics gate. (`tenant.server.ts`, `permissions.server.ts`;
  `require-org-revocation.test.ts`, 3 tests.)
- **Dead client-side passcode gate removed.** `PasscodeGate.tsx` (hardcoded `"0726"`, no server
  validation) is deleted; diagnostics is gated by server RBAC + session revocation only.
  `security.md`, `decisions.md` D3, `release-readiness.md` #16, and `code-standards.md` updated.
- **Dashboard "Live telemetry" is real.** `/admin/dashboard` now subscribes to the SSE stream and
  silently refetches analytics for live-relevant events (`lead:acquired`, `lead:stage_changed`,
  `lead:updated`, `invoice:created`, `payment:recorded`, `stk_push:paid`,
  `reconciliation:matched`); the badge tooltip states exactly what it does.
- **Automation orchestrator cron scheduled.** `vercel.json` adds `/api/cron/automation-orchestrator`
  `*/15 * * * *` (heartbeat stays `*/5 * * * *`); both cron routes fail closed in production
  without `CRON_SECRET` (503, no dev-secret fallback).
- **Three-mode theme (light/dark/system).** `Theme` type widened, `resolveTheme()` follows
  `prefers-color-scheme` live with a matchMedia listener, pre-paint script in `__root.tsx` handles
  system mode, `ThemeToggle` cycles Light → Dark → System with a Monitor icon.
- **Real-UI tests** for previously untested screens: `booking-widget.test.tsx` (full 3-step flow →
  exact submit payload + success screen), `pipeline-board-render.test.tsx` (columns, message
  dispatch via real mutation path, terminal-confirm → update + drag-log + invoice, priority change),
  `theme-toggle.test.tsx` (system default, full cycle, stored-preference load). happy-dom + real
  React root + real `QueryClient`.
- **Settings data export/import paywall-gated.** `/admin/settings/data` export + bulk-import are
  wrapped in `SubscriptionGuard feature="bulk_operations"`; `PaywallModal` upgrade buttons are real
  `mailto:ceo@kayswellnesscentre.org` links (no fake checkout).
- **Operator guide.** `docs/kwc-os-access-guide.md` — OS access (env, login, roles/tiers) + the
  end-to-end screen tour + honest not-live status.

### Changed

- **Automation sends once, honestly.** `automation.server.ts` routes every send branch through
  `dispatchWithBreaker` and writes the `message_ledger` (with automation metadata); the duplicate
  `enqueueNotification` `msg_*` sends are removed.
- **WhatsApp fails closed in production.** `sendWhatsApp` returns
  `{success:false, provider:"unconfigured"}` with an ERROR log when no provider is configured in
  production; dev/test keep the `{success:true, provider:"log"}` harness. No fake successes.
- **Failed M-Pesa STK callbacks page the owner** (new `stk_callback_failed` alert type, deduped by
  `stk:<requestId>` fingerprint).

### Tests

- New: `require-org-revocation.test.ts` (3), `booking-widget.test.tsx` (2),
  `pipeline-board-render.test.tsx` (4), `theme-toggle.test.tsx` (3); strengthened
  `automation.test.ts` (9, no-double-send assertion), `dispatch.test.ts` (16, production
  fail-closed), `mpesa-stk-push.test.ts` (12, owner paging), `session-revocation.test.ts`;
  `theme.test.ts` kept for module exports.
- Full suite: **756 passing across 74 files**, `tsc --noEmit` exit 0, ESLint 0 errors on touched
  files, production build OK, Playwright E2E 5/5.

