  never weakened tsconfig. Root causes: missing `AuditActionType`/`EventType` union values,
  `delete`-on-required-props in logger, postgres `db.unsafe` param typing (new `SqlParam` type),
  TanStack serialization (DTOs for interactions/diagnostics/webhooks), h3 v2 `readRawBody`,
  developer.tsx calling server-only functions (new `api/webhooks.server.ts` createServerFn layer).

