  (`initiateStkPush`, `handleStkCallback`), webhook route `api/webhooks/mpesa.ts`, callback-secret
  auth, idempotent payment recording via `recordPayment`.
- PII encryption wiring (ADR-015): `clinic_leads.name/phone/email` + STK push phone encrypted on
  write, decrypted on read; lazy migration keeps plaintext rows readable.
