  gates, SQL injection in `bookSlot`.
- Production boot guard (throws on default `SESSION_SECRET`), logout endpoint, CI pipeline.
- Rate limiting (login/lead/WhatsApp/reconciliation), RBAC completeness, Docker fix.
- Full engine: multi-tenant schema, billing, scheduling, marketing pipeline, subscriptions,
  metering, trials, checkout, reconciliation, encryption (infra), webhooks, SSE, exports, forecasting.

